= Otto Braun

Sheland, originally Shell-land, is a major metropolis located in the Arcadia Planitia region. Founded as a company town for workers at the local Shell methane refinery, the settlement grew alongside the facility to become one of the most populous urban centers on Mars.

The local {!<span style="color: #ED7158;"><strong>SPM</strong></span>!} branch is among the oldest active political organizations on the planet. While historically rooted in radical leftist ideology, the metropolis's rapid expansion into a commercial and bureaucratic hub has shifted the party's local dynamics. Today, Sheland's {!<span style="color: #ED7158;"><strong>SPM</strong></span>!} serves as the anchor and most influential base for the party's Reformist faction.

