@work_with_mnlp
title: Strengthen our bonds with the {!<span style="color: #D3C24D;"><strong>MNLP</strong></span>!}.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
subtitle: The local sections of both parties have established a long cooperation that we can exploit.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; mnlp_relation += 5

The local {!<span style="color: #D3C24D;"><strong>Martian National Liberal Party</strong></span>!} section has long shared close ties with our own branch. Their ongoing cooperation in Sheland creates a strong foundation of trust, gradually bringing both parties closer together on a planetary scale.

@pushing_reformism
title: Pushing Reformism in the Party
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
subtitle: The local section seeks to push reformist rhetoric into the party.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; reformist_strength += 10; reformist_dissent -= 5; left_dissent += 3

The Sheland branch works to strengthen the party's reformist wing. Naturally, the left wing is displeased.

@small_businesses_propaganda
title: Rally the Independent Capitalists
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
subtitle: Try to shift their views toward supporting the {!<span style="color: #ED7158;"><strong>SPM</strong></span>!}.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; capitalist_class_spm += 2; socialism += 2; left_dissent += 3

We can attempt to claim credit for the {!<span style="color: #D3C24D;"><strong>Martian National Liberal Party</strong></span>!}'s local work to win over small business owners. Uninterested in courting the bourgeoisie, the party's left wing views our efforts as a complete waste of time.
